  "findings": [
    "Original56A510 OR flag belongs to the current row and joins the following row. True OR groups skip remaining predicates, including their closing row; a false complete AND group stops immediately. A final open OR group is accepted according to its Boolean value.",
    "The old portable evaluator attached OR to the previous row and evaluated one following predicate before rejecting an AND group. The old test naming/fixtures encoded that wrong rule and are corrected.",
    "Default live dialogue GetRandomPercent now consumes one shared native raw draw and reduces modulo100. An explicit context uses its supplied raw provider; an absent provider rejects a reached random condition, and invalid raw values are rejected. Generic AI package random policy is unchanged.",
    "Prepared resource queries first validate their contact lease. Enabled participant Health/Fatigue float values are read after staged attacker cost, victim block spending and contact damage without publication. Other AVs/disabled raw-form paths remain normal queries.",
    "Engine tests evaluate post-hit subject/target conditions and a staged raw draw without changing live/serialized state, then commit the same resource packet and random transition. Stale projections return MissingContext before any random draw/publication. Player god mode and Creature Fatigue matrix checks reuse the actual candidate/commit path.",
    "Script-command GetRandomPercent now uses the same shared native raw stream modulo100, replacing the World PRNG. The engine test consumes native condition41/67 followed by script34 and verifies native cursor415139642.",
    "Dialogue evaluation binds its supplied listener Ptr directly instead of dropping valid draft/dynamic targets through registry re-resolution. Generic package target resolution is unchanged. The staged test exposed the missing context; final engines rerun after the fix."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Original list probe supplies Boolean predicate results and clears their extra out flag; unsupported/missing diagnostic statuses and secondary-list composition are not proved by that oracle. Portable status policy has separate tests.",
    "The shared condition evaluator is also used for packages; OR/AND behavior changes to the original rule. No new normal-input package/dialogue gameplay acceptance was run here.",
    "Automatic common-hit speech preparation/publication, post-resource condition wiring into that caller, INFO history/results, and complete M15S4 normal-input/fresh-process acceptance remain open.",
    "ASan leak checks disabled. No actual rendering/audio/runtime course is added by these automated checks."
  ],
